# NOAH - Archive utility

Run NOAH from the drive/user containing NOAH.COM and its matching NOAH.OVL.

## Help libraries

To create a help library from the loose subjects in D0, use:

```text
NOAH /ADD D0:TOOLS.LBR D0:*.HLP
NOAH /TEST D0:TOOLS.LBR
HELP /S=D0:TOOLS.LBR
```

Include an _INDEX.HLP for an authored menu. If you omit it, HELP lists
the topics in archive order. See [choosing a help source](HELP.HLP#choosing-a-source).

## Listing members

```text
NOAH /LIST D0:TOOLS.LBR
NOAH /LIST D0:HELP.ARK
```

Use `/TEST` to check archive data and `/HELP` for the command summary.
